<title>BELGIUM: EU report on agrimoney delayed.</title>
<headline>EU report on agrimoney delayed.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>A European Commission report on the European Union's agri-money system will not be presented to ministers at Monday's farm council, an EU diplomat said.</p>
<p>The report on the so-called green rate system used to calculate CAP payments and compensation was not discussed at Tuesday's special agriculture committee.</p>
<p>&quot;The report was put back for two weeks because some member states said that they had not had time to read it,&quot; the diplomat added.</p>
</text>
